Sorry! Did you wait long?

00:16:21.219 --> 00:16:22.496
It's okay.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:24.732
What were you looking at?

00:16:24.756 --> 00:16:26.266
Never mind that, let's go.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:29.885
What are you in such a hurry for?
| bet you were reading a dirty book.

00:16:30.895 --> 00:16:33.073
Can someone let me borrow their bike?

00:16:33.097 --> 00:16:34.541
I'll give you ten thousand yen.

00:16:34.565 --> 00:16:35.609
What?

00:16:35.633 --> 00:16:40.247
Well, my boyfriend has a bike,
but what do you need it for?

00:16:40.271 --> 00:16:43.684
A lady stalker. She's always on my tail.

00:16:43.708 --> 00:16:46.987
She's behind me to your right.
About half of her is showing.

00:16:47.011 --> 00:16:48.622
She looks like Sadako.

00:16:48.646 --> 00:16:50.391
Scary.

00:16:50.415 --> 00:16:54.561
I'll try asking my boyfriend,
but in return, can I sit behind you?

00:16:54.585 --> 00:16:56.363
Wait a sec!

00:16:56.387 --> 00:16:59.800
That's okay. But I'm not
taking you home or anything.

00:16:59.824 --> 00:17:01.502
Really?!

00:17:01.526 --> 00:17:04.038
--Come here!
--That hurts!

00:17:04.062 --> 00:17:05.139
Let go of me!

00:17:05.163 --> 00:17:10.344
I won't go to the authorities with this,
but in return, listen to what I have to say!

00:17:10.368 --> 00:17:14.381
Young man, just how long were
you planning on keeping this up?

00:17:14.405 --> 00:17:16.450
Just for a little bit.

00:17:16.474 --> 00:17:19.102
--You gotta be kidding me!
--C'mon, please?

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.259
Hey!

00:17:52.877 --> 00:17:55.278
What the hell are you doing?

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:12.052
Masaru, it's my fault.

00:18:14.265 --> 00:18:16.810
"You are already dead.”

00:18:16.834 --> 00:18:19.747
"You are already dead.”

00:18:19.771 --> 00:18:22.716
All right!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.519
Stop!

00:18:25.543 --> 00:18:29.173
Anyway, it doesn't matter. I'm all right.

00:19:00.611 --> 00:19:03.046
He's
scary!

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:10.998
Man, you're tough!

00:19:11.022 --> 00:19:13.457
The one thing I know I'm good at is shogi.

00:19:16.727 --> 00:19:18.456
I'll be back!

00:19:22.834 --> 00:19:25.201
You've got to be kidding me!

00:19:39.383 --> 00:19:45.098
Upsy-daisy, up you go!

00:19:45.122 --> 00:19:46.900
I'm going out to buy some cigarettes.

00:19:46.924 --> 00:19:48.602
Okay, then get more milk.

00:19:48.626 --> 00:19:50.204
What? More?

00:19:50.228 --> 00:19:51.605
The baby drinks a lot of it.

00:19:51.629 --> 00:19:52.573
"Unrivaled Wicked Demon”
The baby drinks a lot of it.

00:19:52.597 --> 00:19:53.359
"Unrivaled Wicked Demon”

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:15.729
Okay, why don't we take
you back to your mother?

00:20:15.753 --> 00:20:17.312
Okay!

00:20:52.089 --> 00:20:55.582
It's about that time. Maybe even tonight.

00:21:16.814 --> 00:21:20.808
"Well, shall we get down to duzinszz?”

00:21:23.054 --> 00:21:30.188
We all start out as pure and innocent babes

00:21:34.665 --> 00:21:41.696
Even if you taste the bitter fruit,
don't be discouraged, walk straight

00:21:46.243 --> 00:21:54.243
I know it's in the past, but the rain still stings

00:22:00.358 --> 00:22:02.602
I'm lonely as floating ice

00:22:02.626 --> 00:22:07.441
I kiss your thin finger

00:22:07.465 --> 00:22:14.147
And remember you crying

00:22:14.171 --> 00:22:19.019
Even if this is the end

00:22:19.043 --> 00:22:23.924
I won't forget your last kiss

00:22:23.948 --> 00:22:31.948
I won't forget... I won't forget...

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:43.860
I won't forget his kiss

00:22:53.878 --> 00:22:57.991
Many new people get drawn in,
and the game of death goes on forever.

00:22:58.015 --> 00:23:00.894
<i>Will the newcomers be able to
understand? Can they survive?</i>

00:23:00.918 --> 00:23:04.064
And if they can't, what should they do?

00:23:04.088 --> 00:23:06.284
Next time: "Uh-oh!”
